  "editorial": {
    "name": "DuckIt-io/duckit-registry",
    "descriptionZh": "Duckit 的组件注册表：按 shadcn/ui Registry API 分发 React 组件源码，装进项目后代码归你自己改，配一个 @duckit/cli 做初始化与安装。",
    "takeawayZh": "用 @duckit/cli 把组件源码装进自己项目。",
    "noteZh": "README 开头写 Modern component registry platform for the React ecosystem，并强调 Unlike traditional npm packages, Duckit distributes source code through a registry compatible with the shadcn/ui Registry API。Packages 表里列出 @duckit/registry（组件注册表元数据）和 @duckit/cli（安装用命令行）两个包，Quick Start 第一步是 npx @duckit/cli@latest init，会生成 components.json 并写入 src/lib/utils。仓库目录里 registry/、packages/、src/ 三层分别对应注册表数据、包和站点源码，最近一次改动是 duckit signature v2 - uniform 16px squircle, borders, shadow；About 栏既没有 description 也没有 license，只有 Readme 和 Activity。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
